= Dr. Ankur Awadhiya, IFS
[mp572@ifs.nic.in]

Welcome to my homepage. I'm an officer in the Indian Forest Service. My CV may be found [./CV-Ankur-Awadhiya.pdf here]. You'll find information about my interests, courses, and writings on this site.

== Research interests

My research interests include Natural Resource Management, Climate Change Mitigation, and Data-driven Policy Making.

